181: Literature retrieval ranks published mixes against the design targets. The exact tier contains mixes whose measured values satisfy every target, and the near tier contains the closest misses. Database questions use schema inspection followed by a read-only SQL query. A keyword filter permits SELECT/WITH statements, and an SQLite authorizer rejects writes and schema changes. Queries have a 20~s timeout and a 200-row limit. Results exceeding 20 rows are returned as a digest, with the full table saved as CSV.
