235: \subsection{Benchmark}\label{sec:bench}
236: 
237: The benchmark contains \nbenchCxN{} tasks in ten groups (Table~\ref{tab:bench}). Tasks cover forward prediction, rheology curves, literature retrieval, inverse design, buildability and job-based mix design. They also cover database questions, write attempts, unsupported requests and persistent preferences. Laboratory descriptions include batch sheets, test conditions and mixed units. Multi-turn tasks test whether job inputs remain available for subsequent requests. The appendix lists the tasks, and the released evaluation package contains the full prompts and checks.
