The revision removes internal development history and editorial instructions while retaining the scientific method, observed failures and limitations. The review followed review/brief.md and review/ccr-style-SKILL.md. Only main.tex and this memo were written in the workspace. Section and paragraph order was retained.

## Passage classification and action

Locations below refer to both the supplied and revised main.tex, whose line numbering is unchanged. A row identifies each changed passage by its original opening. Repeated disclosures are consolidated as indicated.

