Counts are direct, case-insensitive pattern counts where relevant, from the abstract through the end of main.tex. They include its captions but exclude imported gen files, vector-source text, bibliography entries and preamble definitions. LaTeX label identifiers and the URL colon are not prose-colon violations. The inventory covers every hard house-style rule and the listed vocabulary/move families. Sentence structure, stacked hedges, substantive lists and parenthetical length were also reviewed manually.

| Pattern | Before | After |
